Vendored opening theory lines for offline Game Review book seeding.

Source: https://github.com/lichess-org/chess-openings
Files: a.tsv, b.tsv, c.tsv, d.tsv, e.tsv (tab-separated ECO code, name, PGN)
Retrieved: 2026-10-01
License: CC0-1.0 public-domain dedication, as documented for this dataset
in the upstream repository and in services/opening_book.py.

These files exist so fresh databases can seed the opening book without
network access (see seed_eco_book_if_empty in services/opening_book.py).
To refresh from upstream, re-download the five TSVs into this directory.
